BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 648.10 Tm (privileges are suspended, an email giving roughly 14 days to respond, or a call from a number you do not recognize;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 632.87 Tm (call back on the number printed on the back of the card, not the voicemail number, because the clock starts when they) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 617.65 Tm (send the notice [xZwOSYlOyVc @ 00:03:15]. RJ Financial read the actual letter aloud: Amex places a restriction,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 602.42 Tm (requests financial documents, and warns that failure within 14 days can mean cancellation, and calling in routes you to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 587.20 Tm (an assigned specialist rather than regular customer service [vfXgcEGNVuM @ 00:04:13]. On what actually gets) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (requested, Cal Barton's 20-case sample showed only 25% were asked for two years of tax returns while 66% were) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (asked for two months of bank statements or two pay stubs, with verification running one to three weeks depending on) Tj ET
