BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (specific link in the email and include the cover sheet, or nothing gets processed, then expect a call with the decision) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (followed by an explanatory email the same day [w8CgH2R003g @ 00:12:07]. Membership Rewards stay frozen for the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm (duration, so transfers have to be planned before the review starts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (Colin Matthew's playbook doubles as the call script: phone the same day and ask for the financial review department,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (be exceptionally pleasant because humans process these files, send exactly what was asked with nothing extra and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (nothing missing, and have a clean, true, specific story ready, such as a business opened in March or a contractor paid) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (for a renovation, because vague answers extend the review. Then follow up every other day or every few days to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (confirm receipt, and once it clears ask for a goodwill credit on an $800 or $900 annual fee for the weeks you were) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (locked out, or a prorated refund if they close you [xZwOSYlOyVc @ 00:11:42]. AskSebby warns that the review team) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm (is taking notes on the call, so anything you say that conflicts with verifiable documents will hurt you later) Tj ET
