BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.92 Tm (reach 15K goes to 5K next month, 10K the month after, then 15K, uses the spend authorization process before a big) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.70 Tm (charge rather than after a decline, pays early from one verified bank account, and keeps two months of statements, the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 267.47 Tm (latest pay stub and two years of returns in a ready folder [xZwOSYlOyVc @ 00:13:41]. Simon Katz relayed a) Tj ET
