BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 656.32 Tm (75,000 dollar limit and a 25.49 percent variable APR, calls that a very very high rate, and says they would never) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 641.10 Tm (normally carry a balance on a card like that [zOrHXaEEgxk @ 00:03:01]. Matthew Perry lays out the penalty ladder: a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 625.87 Tm (late fee of 39 dollars or 1.5 percent of the past-due amount, jumping to 2.99 percent if the balance goes unpaid for two) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 610.65 Tm (billing periods in a row, plus a 39 dollar returned payment fee, and the account can go to collection and damage credit) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 595.42 Tm ([eEtyddAIvq8 @ 00:08:10]. Elliot Explains adds that the owner carries personal liability for all charges, so personal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 580.20 Tm (assets are on the hook if the business defaults [yssYp2uZMdg @ 00:01:00]. Bytes Media warns that stretching) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 564.97 Tm (payments without a clear plan quickly leads to interest charges that are not particularly low compared with other) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 549.75 Tm (business credit [Q12R7gbPW8g @ 00:01:36]. The operational lesson across all four: the float only works if the exit) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 534.52 Tm (cash is already identified before the charge is swiped, which is exactly how Smith says they run it, never buying) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 519.30 Tm (anything they lack the cash on hand to cover.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 504.07 Tm (The second trap is reading no preset spending limit as unlimited. u2 credit consulting says it does not mean an infinite) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 488.85 Tm (amount of credit; the limit varies with use, a holder may be approved for twenty thousand or up to fifty thousand, some) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 473.62 Tm (people reach a hundred thousand to three hundred thousand, and starting out they would not go crazy, using the card) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 458.40 Tm (like a regular one [UYH3UwJ9oOM @ 00:01:56]. CREDNCARD makes the same point at scale: purchasing capacity) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 443.17 Tm (varies, individual transactions may still be declined, and an unusually large purchase should be verified first rather than) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 427.95 Tm (assumed [9HLY-5lw8uA @ 00:01:21]. Jake Broe describes the workaround, calling Amex ahead of a large purchase so) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 412.72 Tm (they can authorize it, which only works with a good payment relationship [UdDb_X5YHDI @ 00:04:37].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 397.50 Tm (CREDNCARD then flags the bigger operational risk: if millions in annual expenses run through one ecosystem, a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 382.27 Tm (temporary fraud review, a decline, an account restriction or a payment processing problem can disrupt company) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 367.05 Tm (operations, so a serious card stack should not depend entirely on a single payment instrument. Their fix is to hold) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 351.82 Tm (multiple payment methods and allocate spend by each card's strengths, with a flat-rate card on general operating costs) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 336.60 Tm (and a second card where bonuses or purchasing capacity win [9HLY-5lw8uA @ 00:07:00].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 321.37 Tm (The third check is the break-even math on the early-pay discount. Daniel Shepherd prices it plainly: 5,000 dollars paid) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 306.15 Tm (within 10 days of the statement date returns 75 dollars, 50,000 a year returns 750, simply covering the 250 dollar fee) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 290.92 Tm (takes a little over 16,600 dollars of early-paid spend, and a business that does not spend much or struggles to pay its) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 275.70 Tm (bills probably should not look at it [a0APMJagyzA @ 00:02:54]. Elliot Explains puts the recoup point around 17,000) Tj ET
