BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 245.25 Tm (side a trap for exactly that reason: the operator must always pay within 10 days of statement closing rather than on the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 230.02 Tm (normal due date, and any month that slips earns nothing [UdDb_X5YHDI @ 00:12:30]. Points Panda notes the 10-day) Tj ET
